openspec/changes/cycle-15-actuation-intent-retrieval-expansion/design.md:3:See `proposal.md` for motivation and the capability specification for behavioral requirements. `query_canonicalization.py` already produces one pure alternate query, and `HybridRetriever` executes source and alternate retrieval per modality, deduplicates IDs, applies current RRF, and fails open if alternate retrieval raises. `NomenclatureMatcher` continues to pass the source query to the reranker.
