openspec/changes/cycle-15-actuation-intent-retrieval-expansion/design.md:23:Use deterministic phrase patterns that distinguish supplied/installed electric actuation (for example, `с электроприводом`) from preparation/readiness (for example, `под электропривод`). Leave bare `привод`, bare `электро`, and conflicting/unclear wording state-neutral. This matches the existing canonicalizer's conservative approach and makes both false-positive boundaries testable.
